# WHAT IS DELIBERATELY TRACKED, so that a later edit has to argue with a
# sentence before it can drop it:
#
#   results/*.json   THE EVIDENCE. Every number in README.md is derived from
#                    these by scripts/check_readme_numbers.py, and the test
#                    suite asserts against them. A repository that ignored
#                    them would pass every existence check and be useless.
#   service/         the decision service, which is the subject
#   scripts/, sql/   the experiments, the generator and the schema
#   stack/           the compose file and the service image definition
#
# THERE IS NO data/ DIRECTORY TO IGNORE. The generated world is never written
# to disk: scripts/load.py builds it in memory from the seed and streams it
# into Postgres, and every results file carries the manifest sha256 of the
# input it was measured on, so a reader who regenerates can prove they hold
# the same world rather than take it on trust.
#
# Excluded below is only what a clone can rebuild.

envs
.venv
__pycache__
.pytest_cache
*.pyc
.DS_Store
